    <string name="onb1_title">Ad blocking for the whole phone</string>
    <string name="onb1_body">CleanWeb blocks ad networks, trackers, redirect domains and malicious sites in every browser and app.\n\nIt works without root. Everything is checked on this phone; your browsing history is never sent anywhere.</string>
    <string name="onb2_title">Allow the local VPN</string>
    <string name="onb2_body">Android will ask to allow a VPN connection. It is local: traffic does not go to our servers, it only passes through the filter on your phone.\n\nA key icon will appear in the status bar while protection is on.</string>
    <string name="onb2_button">Allow and turn on</string>
